[["wrb.fr",null,"[null,[\"c_8f65b23e23c26473\",\"r_04698e3d18eb5214\"],null,null,[[\"rc_c29ecaaa3842ea9f\",[\"### Valuation Forecasts (Year-End 2026)\\n\\nFollowing major capital events and secondary market valuations escalating from **$800 billion** in late 2025 past the **$1.0 trillion** mark, current institutional models and market analysts project SpaceX's enterprise/market valuation to settle within the following ranges by the end of 2026:\\n\\n| Scenario | Year-End Valuation Range | Implied Share Price Range | Core Underlying Drivers |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Bear Case** | **$700B – $900B** | $70 – $100 | Heavy Capex drag, severe multi-tranche lock-up supply dilution, margin compression. |\\n| **Base Case** | **$1.20T – $1.45T** | $135 – $180 | Steady Starlink free cash flow expansion, consolidated AI revenue scaling, multiple normalization. |\\n| **Bull Case** | **$1.75T – $2.10T** | $220 – $280 | Starship operationalization, accelerated direct-to-cell telecom rollouts, scarcity multiple retention. |\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Key Upside Catalysts\\n\\n1. **Starlink Cash Generation \\u0026 Direct-to-Cell Expansion**  \\n   Starlink's consumer and enterprise subscriber base continues to provide high-margin, recurring software-like revenue. The deployment of direct-to-cell capabilities via spectrum agreements enables telco-partner monetization, broadening the addressable market beyond fixed broadband.\\n\\n2. **Starship Cadence \\u0026 Commercial Readiness**  \\n   Transitioning Starship into routine payload delivery dramatically reduces cost-per-kilogram to orbit compared to Falcon 9. This unlocks rapid Starlink Gen2 deployments, high-margin NASA Artemis lunar lander milestones, and defense/national security payload contracts.\\n\\n3. **Consolidated Infrastructure \\u0026 Compute Synergies**  \\n   Integration of advanced AI compute infrastructure and cross-entity compute demand creates an additive valuation premium beyond traditional aerospace multiples, driving multiple expansion into mega-cap tech territory\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[[[],\"Searched the web\",\"Google Search\",\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/productlogos/googleg/v6/192px.svg\",[],\"Searched the web\",\"\",[[\"https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://satnews.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://satnews.com/2025/12/06/spacex-targets-800-billion-valuation-in-secondary-sale-eyes-2026-ipo/\",\"SpaceX Targets $800 Billion Valuation in Secondary Sale, Eyes\",null,[]],[\"https://t2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.ebc.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://www.ebc.com/forex/spacex-ipo-in-2026-valuation-date-and-how-to-invest\",\"SpaceX IPO in 2026? Valuation, Date and How to Invest\",null,[]],[\"https://t2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://forgeglobal.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://forgeglobal.com/insights/spacex-upcoming-ipo-news/\",\"Insights: SpaceX Upcoming IPO \\u0026 Private Stock Price - Forge Global\",null,[]],[\"https://t1.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.markets.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://www.markets.com/analysis/spacex-stock-price-prediction\",\"SpaceX Stock Price Prediction 2026, 2027, 2030 \\u0026 2040\",null,[]],[\"https://t2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://futuresearch.ai/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://futuresearch.ai/spacex-ipo-valuation/\