fense/national security payload contracts.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Consolidated Infrastructure \\u0026 Compute Synergies\",[[0,47,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Integration of advanced AI compute infrastructure and cross-entity compute demand creates an additive valuation premium beyond traditional aerospace multiples, driving multiple expansion into mega-cap tech territory.\"]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Downside Risks\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Lock-Up Expirations \\u0026 Float Expansion\",[[0,37,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"As early investor, employee, and insider lock-up periods expire toward the end of the year, tradable float increases substantially. The removal of float scarcity can introduce heavy institutional supply overhang and downward pricing pressure.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Capital Expenditure Intensity \\u0026 Cash Burn\",[[0,41,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Mass-producing Starship, building orbital refueling architecture, and expanding launch facilities require immense recurring Capex. Prolonged development cycles or flight-test regulatory delays can suppress near-term margins and free cash flow yields.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Multiple Cont\"]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.