reements enables telco-partner monetization, broadening the addressable market beyond fixed broadband.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Cadence \\u0026 Commercial Readiness\",[[0,39,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Transitioning Starship into routine payload delivery dramatically reduces cost-per-kilogram to orbit compared to Falcon 9. This unlocks rapid Starlink Gen2 deployments, high-margin NASA Artemis lunar lander milestones, and defense/national security payload contracts.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Consolidated Infrastructure \\u0026 Compute Synergies\",[[0,47,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Integration of advanced AI compute infrastructure and cross-entity compute demand creates an additive valuation premium beyond traditional aerospace multiples, driving multiple expansion into mega-cap tech territory.\"]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Downside Risks\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Lock-Up Expirations \\u0026 Float Expansion\",[[0,37,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"As early investor, employee, and insider lock-up periods expire toward the end of the year, tradable float increases substantially. The removal of float scarcity can introduce heavy institutional supply overhang and downward pricing pressure.\",[[0,131,[null,null,null,[null,[\"spp_dd30b73e7c04218\"]]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Capital Expenditure Intensity \\u0026 Cash Burn\",[[0,41,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Mass-producing Starship, building orbital refueling architecture, and expanding launch facilities require immense recurring Capex. Prolonged development cycles or flight-test regulatory delays can suppress near-term margins and free cash flow yields.\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Multiple Contraction \\u0026 Tech Sector Sensitivity\",[[0,46,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,[null,0,\"Trading at forward price-to-sales multiples characteristic of high-growth tech firms leaves the valuation sensitive to broader macroeconomic interest rate pressures and regulatory scrutiny in communications and aerospace.\"]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Sources\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"SatNews – SpaceX Secondary Sale and IPO Targets\",[[0,47,[null,[\"https://satnews.com/2025/12/06/spacex-targets-800-billion-valuation-in-secondary-sale-eyes-2026-ipo/\"]]],[0,47,[null,null,null,[null,[\"spp_80f910aabc2944b8\"]]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Forge Global – SpaceX Private Markets and Pre-IPO Insights\",[[0,58,[null,[\"https://forgeglobal.com/insights/spacex-upcoming-ipo-news/\"]]],[0,58,[null,null,null,[null,[\"spp_7533acdab5be42ce\"]]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Markets.com – SpaceX Valuation Models and Projections\",[[0,53,[null,[\"https://www.markets.com/analysis/spacex-stock-price-prediction\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"FutureSearch – SpaceX Post-Listing Fair Value Forecast\",[[0,54,[null,[\"https://futuresearch.ai/spacex-ipo-valuation/\"]]],[0,54,[null,null,null,[null,[\"spp_9684ff36e20b4e32\"]]]]]]]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null